  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Beta of mdAT 2.0: framework-independent core. Own JSON comparison engine (no xunit/Quibble dependency), ignoreArrayOrder option, net8.0/net9.0/net10.0. See the migration section of the README. Beta 2: a JsonDocument or JsonElement whose root is a string holding a JSON object or array is written as that object or array again (mdAT 1.4 behaviour); parallelism and code coverage notes added to the migration guide. Beta 3: the test explorer now points each case to its title in the markdown file (or to the start of its document in a YAML file) instead of the C# method. Beta 4: a test case is named Method_Title@file.md (file name last, no path); the title of the raw output written by Verify.Assert shows readable type names (for example List of JsonNode instead of the compiler name).",
